      "source": "<a href=\"KeyValueEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.event\"><code>KeyValueEvent</code></a> gets published for operations executed by eg.\n<a href=\"../KeyValueTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueTemplate</code></a>.\n\nUse the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/keyvalue/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/event/KeyValueEvent.KeyBasedEvent.html#getType()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.event\"><code>KeyValueEvent.KeyBasedEvent.getType()</code></a> to determine which event has been emitted.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"KeyValueEvent.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.event.KeyValueEvent\"><code>KeyValueEvent</code></a> 会在由例如 <a href=\"../KeyValueTemplate.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.KeyValueTemplate\"><code>KeyValueTemplate</code></a> 执行的操作发布时发出。\n\n使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/keyvalue/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/event/KeyValueEvent.KeyBasedEvent.html#getType()\" title=\"类或接口 org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.event.KeyValueEvent.KeyBasedEvent\">《KeyValueEvent.KeyBasedEvent.getType()》</a> 来确定已发出的是哪种事件。",
